<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">3. The approval, on an
advisory basis, of the compensation paid to the Company&#8217;s named executive officers was ratified by the stockholders by the votes
set forth below:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

