    <td>Against:</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right">4,870,451</td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td>Abstain:</td><td>&#160;</td>
