<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">5. The authorization
of the adjournment, if necessary or appropriate, of the Annual Meeting, including to solicit additional proxies if there are not sufficient
votes at the time of the Annual Meeting to approve any of the foregoing proposals, was ratified by the stockholders by the votes set forth
below:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

